meless protein</article-title><source>J Neurosci</source><volume>23</volume><fpage>7810</fpage><lpage>7819</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12944510</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi-0030154-b018"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chang</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name><name><surname>Reppert</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>A novel C-terminal domain of <italic>Drosophila</italic> PERIOD inhibits dCLOCK:CYCLE-mediated transcription</article-title><source>Curr Biol</source><volume>13</volume><fpage>758</fpage><lpage>762</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12725734</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi-0030154-b019"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nawathean</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosbash</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>The Doubletime and CKII kinases collaborate to potentiate <italic>Drosophila</italic> PER transcriptional repressor activity</article-title><source>Mol Cell</source><volume>13</volume><fpage>213</fpage><lpage>223</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14759367</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi-0030154-b020"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cyran</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name><name><surname>Yiannoulos</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Buchsbaum</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Saez</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Young</surname><given-names>MW</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>The Double-Time protein kinase regulates the subcellular localization of the <italic>Drosophila</italic> clock protein Period</article-title><source>J Neurosci</source><volume>25</volume><fpage>5430</fpage><lpage>54